l>\n<p><strong>Job Description</strong></p>\n<p>Codeatrix is looking for motivated AI/ML Interns to work on industry-oriented projects involving Artificial Intelligence, Machine Learning, and data-driven solutions. Interns will work with datasets, develop machine learning models, evaluate results, and explore AI technologies to solve practical business and technical challenges.</p>\n<p><strong>Day-to-Day Roles and Responsibilities</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Work on AI/ML projects involving industry-relevant problems and datasets.</li>\n<li>Clean, preprocess, and analyze data using Python, Pandas, NumPy, and Scikit-learn.</li>\n<li>Implement supervised and unsupervised machine learning algorithms.</li>\n<li>Train, test, evaluate, and optimize models using appropriate techniques and performance metrics.</li>\n<li>Explore Generative AI, Natural Language Processing (NLP), or computer vision based on project requirements.</li>\n<li>Document findings, troubleshoot issues, and collaborate with the team to improve project outcomes.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Who Can Apply?</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>College students from any year, freshers, recent graduates, and experienced candidates.</li>\n<li>Candidates from Computer Science, IT, AI, Data Science, Engineering, Mathematics, Statistics, or related fields are preferred.</li>\n<li>Candidates from other academic backgrounds with an interest in AI/ML are also welcome.</li>\n<li>Applicants should have analytical thinking, problem-solving skills, and a willingness to learn.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Preferred Skills</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Basic knowledge of Python and programming fundamentals.</li>\n<li>Familiarity with machine learning, statistics, or data analysis.</li>\n<li>Knowledge of Pandas, NumPy, or Scikit-learn is an advantage.</li>\n<li>Familiarity with Git/GitHub, Jupyter Notebook, or Google Colab is beneficial.</li>\n<li>Prior academic or personal projects are welcome but not mandatory.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Selection Process</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Application screening based on qualifications and relevant skills.</li>\n<li>Technical assessment or discussion, where applicable.</li>\n<li>Interaction with the team for shortlisted candidates.</li>\n<li>Selected candidates receive onboarding instructions and project details.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>How to Apply</strong></p>\n<p>Interested candidates can apply through the internship application portal by providing accurate details about their education, technical skills, projects, and prior experience, if applicable.</p>\n<p>Join Codeatrix to gain experience working on technology-driven projects in the evolving field of Artificial Intelligence and Machine Learning.</p>", "short_id": "fRrxU0B", "logoUrl2": "https://d8it4huxumps7.cloudfront.net/uploads/images/150x150/6af34b8d78949_organisation_image-xmFQPJOTOZ959357614lYZeDdopE7.png", "organisation": {"id": 2077917, "name": "Codeatrix", "public_url": "c/codeatrix-2077917", "logoUrl": "https://d8it4huxumps7.cloudfront.net/images/partners/new_organisation_image-xmFQPJOTOZ959357614lYZeDdopE7.png", "logoUrl2": "https://d8it4huxumps7.cloudfront.net/images/partners/new_organisation_image-xmFQPJOTOZ959357614lYZeDdopE7.png", "show_evaluator_login_link": false, "official_email_domains": null, "tier": null}, "seo_url": "https://unstop.com/internships/aiml-internship-codeatrix-1803891", "status": "LIVE", "tags": [], "thumb": null, "isPaid": false, "festival": null, "prizes": [], "address_with_country_logo": {"address": "", "city": "", "state": "", "country": ""}, "short_url": "https://unstop.com/o/fRrxU0B", "workfunction": [{"id": 2107, "name": "AI Engineering", "description": "", "created_at": "2026-04-09T00:17:10+05:30", "updated_at": "2026-04-09T00:17:10+05:30", "work_function_name": null, "batch_id": 11, "pivot": {"entity_id": 1803891, "subject_id": 2107, "id": 6828926, "ai_generated": false}}, {"id": 1854, "name": "Machine Learning Engineering", "description": "", "created_at": "2026-02-06T23:31:4